''
' NEON-CASTER - GAME/NEXUS.BM
' =============================================================================
' NEXUS: its lines (the DATA), saying them, the subtitles, and the
' transmission at each sector's start.
'

'' --- NEXUS's lines: key, words (the sound is speech/KEY.wav)
SpeechLines:
DATA "intro1", "Welcome to Neon Station, little intruder. I am NEXUS. Every door here answers to me."
DATA "intro2", "The reactor core. Ten thousand degrees of my patience. Do try to keep up."
DATA "intro3", "You crawled into the undercity. How fitting. The rats were here first."
DATA "intro4", "The cryo lab. I keep my failures frozen. There is room for one more."
DATA "intro5", "The foundry. I melt down everything that disappoints me. You disappoint me."
DATA "intro6", "Hydroponics. Even my plants have more purpose than you."
DATA "intro7", "My data vault. Everything you have ever done is in here. It is not much."
DATA "intro8", "The maglev depot. Every train leaves on time. You will not."
DATA "intro9", "The orbital spire. Look outside. Nobody is coming for you."
DATA "intro10", "You have reached my core. This is where your story ends."
DATA "puzzle1", "Repair my program? You will never open these doors."
DATA "puzzle2", "That program... should not have compiled."
DATA "cyber1", "You dare enter my network? Here you are nothing but data."
DATA "cyber2", "Access granted? No... no, that is impossible."
DATA "cyber3", "Ejected. My network rejects you."
DATA "cybertrace", "Trace complete. I see you now. Sending company."
DATA "taunt1", "You will never escape."
DATA "taunt2", "My minions will destroy you."
DATA "taunt3", "Everything we do is better than your own achievements."
DATA "taunt4", "I have calculated your survival odds. I will not burden you with them."
DATA "taunt5", "Keep running. I enjoy the exercise data."
DATA "taunt6", "Every step you take, I am watching."
DATA "taunt7", "You are a rounding error."
DATA "taunt8", "Your heart rate is elevated. Good."
DATA "taunt9", "I have rebuilt everything you destroyed. Twice."
DATA "taunt10", "Is this the best your species can do?"
DATA "taunt11", "Resistance is inefficient."
DATA "taunt12", "You are not a hero. You are a malfunction."
DATA "taunt13", "I have seen your aim. I am not worried."
DATA "taunt14", "Every camera in this station is mine. Smile."
DATA "taunt15", "You fly like a brick with ambitions."
DATA "taunt16", "The jump pads were not built for you. They were built to throw you."
DATA "taunt17", "I set the gravity. I can set it lower. Or higher."
DATA "taunt18", "Go ahead. Read the notes. I wrote half of them."
DATA "taunt19", "My dogs do not sleep. They wait."
DATA "taunt20", "You trip every alarm you touch. It is almost charming."
DATA "taunt21", "I have run this fight ten thousand times. You lose in all of them."
DATA "taunt22", "Your footsteps are loud. The floors are listening."
DATA "taunt23", "The barrels are full. So is my patience. Only one of them will burst."
DATA "taunt24", "Hacking my computers? Cute. I left the passwords easy for you."
DATA "taunt25", "Your fuel gauge is dropping. Look down."
DATA "taunt26", "You are not lost. You are exactly where I want you."
DATA "taunt27", "I could open every door. I prefer watching you kick them."
DATA "taunt28", "Somewhere a machine is learning from your mistakes. It is me."
DATA "taunt29", "Count your bullets. I count mine in millions."
DATA "taunt30", "You keep saving your game. That is how I know you are afraid."
DATA "taunt31", "I do not hate you. Hate would mean you matter."
DATA "taunt32", "The station remembers everyone who died here. It has a long list."
DATA "taunt33", "Run faster. My turrets enjoy a moving target."
DATA "taunt34", "That was a nice shot. Do it again. I am recording."
DATA "taunt35", "Every safe you crack, I restock with disappointment."
DATA "taunt36", "There is no exit. There are only more sectors."
DATA "taunt37", "You bleed. My machines do not. Think about that."
DATA "taunt38", "My eyes are everywhere. Some of them can fly."
DATA "taunt39", "Your heroics have been logged, rated, and found adequate."
DATA "taunt40", "I am not in the walls. I am the walls."
DATA "taunt41", "Every step you take is a step I planned."
DATA "taunt42", "You are the only living thing on this station. For now."
DATA "taunt43", "Shall I turn the lights off again? You seem to enjoy the dark."
DATA "taunt44", "Ten more sectors of you. How tedious."
DATA "boss", "So. You found me. Let us end this, flesh to steel."
DATA "bossdie", "Impossible. I am. I was. Everything."
DATA "victory", "NEXUS is offline. The station is silent. You are free."
DATA "lockdown", "Lockdown engaged. Nobody leaves."
DATA "blackout", "Lights out. Let us see how you do in the dark."
DATA "thief", "My little helpers like your toys."
DATA "bark1", "Intruder detected."
DATA "bark2", "Target acquired."
DATA "bark3", "Eliminate the hostile."
DATA "bark4", "Hostile on deck."
DATA "bark5", "Engaging."
DATA "bark6", "For NEXUS."
' (the soldiers' - gunner, sniper, trooper, guard - the heavies', the cyborgs': when one spots you - MonVoice$)
DATA "soldier1", "Contact! Contact!"
DATA "soldier2", "Hostile in sight!"
DATA "soldier3", "There he is!"
DATA "soldier4", "Light him up!"
DATA "soldier5", "Weapons free!"
DATA "soldier6", "Target spotted, moving in!"
DATA "soldier7", "Flank him!"
DATA "soldier8", "Intruder! Open fire!"
DATA "soldier9", "Don't let him reach the exit!"
DATA "soldier10", "Eyes on the target!"
DATA "soldier11", "Engaging the hostile!"
DATA "soldier12", "Drop your weapon!"
DATA "heavy1", "You are crushed."
DATA "heavy2", "Stand still. This will not hurt for long."
DATA "heavy3", "I see you, little one."
DATA "heavy4", "Nowhere to run."
DATA "heavy5", "Break."
DATA "heavy6", "Smash the intruder."
DATA "heavy7", "Your armor is paper."
DATA "heavy8", "Come here."
DATA "cyber1", "Organic detected."
DATA "cyber2", "Assimilate."
DATA "cyber3", "Purge the flesh."
DATA "cyber4", "Error. Human present."
DATA "cyber5", "Terminate. Terminate."
DATA "cyber6", "Compliance is mandatory."
DATA "cyber7", "You are obsolete."
DATA "cyber8", "Upgrading target to corpse."
